Calyban catalog
Copyright (c) 2026 nemesisLLC. All rights reserved, except as granted below.

This repository is public so the Calyban app (https://calyban.com) can download its
catalog. Being able to read it does not by itself grant you any rights.

WHAT THIS COVERS
- "Code": the build scripts, importers, ranking and curation logic (everything under
  src/, plus sources.json and the workflow files).
- "Catalog": the published catalog (index.json, items/*.json, stats.json) and the curated
  entries under items/, which are a compilation owned by nemesisLLC.

1. Use by Calyban. nemesisLLC and the official Calyban app may use the Code and the
   Catalog without limit.

2. Use by anyone else, only with prominent credit. You may use, copy and adapt the Code
   and/or the Catalog in your own project only if ALL of these are true:
   a. Your product shows, where its users will see it (for example on its main
      screen, about page or catalog page, not only in a licence file), the line:
          "Catalog powered by Calyban: https://calyban.com"
      with a working link to https://calyban.com.
   b. The first section of your README or documentation states that your project uses
      the Calyban catalog and links to https://calyban.com and to this repository.
   c. You keep this licence and the copyright notice above with any copy of the Code
      or Catalog you distribute.
   d. You do not use the name "Calyban" or the Calyban logo to name or brand your own
      product, or suggest that nemesisLLC endorses it.
   If any of these stop being true, your permission ends automatically.

3. Everything else is reserved. Any use not allowed by section 2 (for example
   republishing the Catalog without the required credit, or reselling it) needs written
   permission from nemesisLLC.

4. Listed projects. Each listed MCP server, skill, subagent, command and plugin belongs to
   its own authors and stays under its own licence. The Catalog stores only metadata and
   links to the original sources; credit and licences always point back to them.

5. No warranty. THE CODE AND CATALOG ARE PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND.
   IN NO EVENT SHALL NEMESISLLC BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY
   ARISING FROM THEIR USE.

